OL,3,ASeven missing after multi-storey
OL,4,Abuilding collapses in Kenya's capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA search and rescue effort is under way
OL,7,Fto find seven people feared trapped
OL,8,Funder rubble after a building collapsed
OL,9,Fin the Kenyan capital, Nairobi.
OL,11,FDramatic footage shows the bottom floor
OL,12,Fof the block, thought to have been 16
OL,13,For 18 storeys, giving way before the
OL,14,Frest of the building crumples, sending
OL,15,Fa plume of dust into the surrounding
OL,16,Fstreets.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
