OL,3,ASeven missing after multi-storey
OL,4,Abuilding collapses in Kenya's capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of builders had been working on
OL,7,Fthe upper floors when it collapsed, but
OL,8,Fmanaged to emerge largely unscathed.
OL,9,FThose missing were thought to have been
OL,10,Fin shops that had opened at the base of
OL,11,Fthe building.
OL,13,FThe incident has raised fresh concerns
OL,14,Fabout construction standards and
OL,15,Fregulations in Kenya.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
